<item><title>EU, US and partners urge Sudan&apos;s warring sides to open aid routes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/eu-us-and-partners-urge-sudan-s-warring-sides-to-open-aid-907bd7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/eu-us-and-partners-urge-sudan-s-warring-sides-to-open-aid-907bd7/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>A joint warning says 19.5 million people face acute food insecurity and calls for support for Sudan&apos;s winter planting season.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:52:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/eu-us-and-partners-urge-sudan-s-warring-sides-to-open-aid-907bd7/share.jpg" length="42959" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/eu-us-and-partners-urge-sudan-s-warring-sides-to-open-aid-907bd7/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
